      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29e939bf37e9c0ca",
      "translationZh": "这个想法来自另一个帖子或评论。我忘了具体是哪里，但基本思路是把 Qwen 3.8 Next 中的 51B N-gram 层替换为精度高得多的版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d1cc8db7360002a",
      "translationZh": "有人用 5090 运行模型，将其 Qwen 3.8 UD Q4 模型的 N-gram 部分替换成了 BF16。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87e67489b095f1fe",
      "translationZh": "由于我已经在用 IQ4_XS，我也想试试类似的做法。我目前没有足够的存储空间来放 BF16 N-gram 权重，所以改用 Q8 替换了低精度的 N-gram 部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5863207877bb8740",
      "translationZh": "我还在测试这是否能改善模型的实际输出，但就推理速度而言，差异似乎非常小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc2b7b18ec6f7038",
      "translationZh": "加装 Q8 N-gram 之前：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbd6117581df7d8f",
      "translationZh": "在 IQ4_XS 上加装 Q8 N-gram 之后：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "551fae5909cb3f01",
      "translationZh": "到目前为止，将低精度 N-gram 层替换为 Q8 似乎没有带来任何明显的速度损失。实际输出质量仍在测试中。看起来 Q8 Ngram 更快，但最终两者在稳态下都维持在大约 10.1~ tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e4d9054d3eecdf7",
      "translationZh": "而且没有使用 MTP，因为我用的是 unsloth 较早的合并版本，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0b9d344bab00336",
      "translationZh": "内存 96GB DDR4（32x3，三通道已启用，2400MHZ）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3dac6e4b18662cc",
      "translationZh": "RTX 3090 功耗限制为 250 W",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
